      "id": "line-22",
      "parent": null,
      "turn": 21,
      "speaker": "X",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "Some argue that if a system functionally replicates the information processing of a human, it must have equivalent internal experiences. But then, how could we ever audit or measure that?",
